# mac-memory-watch
owner: looker · cadence: human phrase · status: SUGGESTED
**Watch your box memory while TurboFit runs, so we can catch server kills before you see them.**

## Prompt
Check active TurboFit server pids on :11606 and :11612, read current unified memory pressure, and report whether either process is being killed or swapped under load.

## Evidence
> 26GB used, 5.7GB free, heavy swapping. The model needs 23.6GB peak and my Mac doesn't have enough free RAM alongside the main 27B
